{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415343","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415343","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1041534301:1":{"text":"隆冬节快到了，真怀念呀。","source_cn":"隆冬节快到了，真怀念呀。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60F8EEA5BAC2E316","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041534302:1":{"text":"每次看到雪灯树，我就会想起薄暮丛林的流荧树——当然，是从你们的梦中！","source_cn":"每次看到雪灯树，我就会想起薄暮丛林的流荧树——当然，是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A29B6CB388EC5BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041534303:1":{"text":"毕竟雪灯树一开始就是薄暮丛林的人们纪念流荧树才搞出来的装饰。","source_cn":"毕竟雪灯树一开始就是薄暮丛林的人们纪念流荧树才搞出来的装饰。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0CF33A85AF534DF0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041534304:1":{"text":"无论在大陆任何一个地方，只要抬起头看到飘落的雪花……","source_cn":"无论在大陆任何一个地方，只要抬起头看到飘落的雪花……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7470973B6D6DBE12","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041534305:1":{"text":"看到璀璨的灯光下依旧青翠的树枝，离乡的人就不会感到孤独。","source_cn":"看到璀璨的灯光下依旧青翠的树枝，离乡的人就不会感到孤独。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB2EE41122618DF1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041534306:1":{"text":"是啊，我曾经在无数离乡的游子梦中看到过那熟悉的枝叶。","source_cn":"是啊，我曾经在无数离乡的游子梦中看到过那熟悉的枝叶。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19322D4A4ECD2F64","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041534307:1":{"text":"不过，我怎么感到，现在反而是在家等待的亲人比较孤独呢？","source_cn":"不过，我怎么感到，现在反而是在家等待的亲人比较孤独呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x425ABECA3F721131","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041534308:1":{"text":"哼，洛桑那家伙，不知道又玩到哪去了，我才不会想他呢！","source_cn":"哼，洛桑那家伙，不知道又玩到哪去了，我才不会想他呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B8785EF1BE42C0D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:塔西":{"text":"塔西","source":"塔西","status":"source"},"speaker:莱卡":{"text":"莱卡","source":"莱卡","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":2}}